<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP CLOSE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP CLOSE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the second day of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Friday:</p>
<p>In Berbice, Guyana: Guyana 281 (Carl Hooper 119, Clayton Lambert 55; Ian Bishop 5-82), Trinidad and Tobago 244-5 (P.Simmons 78 not out, D.Ganga 54).</p>
<p>In St Catherine, Jamaica: Jamaica 156 and 125-2 (I.Garrick 50). Leeward Islands 145 (F.Rose 6-63).</p>
</text>
